SELECT 'gongkao', '全异关系', 'kp-xc-analogy-ext-disjoint', CAST($${"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":1},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"全异关系"}]},{"type":"highlightBlock","attrs":{"backgroundColor":"#fffbeb","borderColor":"#f59e0b","icon":"💡"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"核心结论：","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"两个词的范围完全不重叠，没有任何交集。如「猫:桌子」「红色:三角形」。约 18 题，属于极低频考点。"}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"一、题型识别"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"两个词来自完全不同的领域"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"无法用任何关系造句"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"二、易错点"}]},{"type":"highlightBlock","attrs":{"backgroundColor":"#fef2f2","borderColor":"#ef4444","icon":"⚠️"},"content":[{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"全异关系和并列关系的区别：并列是同一大类下的不同事物，全异是完全不同领域"}]}]}]}]},{"type":"highlightBlock","attrs":{"backgroundColor":"#eff6ff","borderColor":"#3b82f6","icon":"📊"},"content":[{"type":"paragraph","content":[{"type":"text","text":"刷题建议：","marks":[{"type":"bold"}]},{"type":"text","text":"全异关系题量极少，了解概念即可。"}]}]}]}$$ AS jsonb), NULL, '类比推理-外延关系-全异关系：两个词的范围完全不重叠。', category_node.id, CAST('["类比推理", "外延关系", "全异关系"]' AS jsonb), FALSE, TRUE, TRUE, NOW(), 0, 0, CAST('{"content_type": "knowledge_point", "category_code": "kp_xc_analogy_extension_disjoint", "source": "fba_content_engine"}' AS jsonb), 1, NOW()
FROM category_node ON CONFLICT (slug) DO UPDATE SET title = EXCLUDED.title, content_json = EXCLUDED.content_json, summary = EXCLUDED.summary, category_id = EXCLUDED.category_id, tags = EXCLUDED.tags, extra = EXCLUDED.extra, updated_time = NOW();
